  <html:p>At drain, what does the head <fr:link href="/UNB6/" title="Store buffer" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/UNB6/" display-uri="UNB6" type="local">Store buffer</fr:link> entry do for each L1D <fr:link href="/30XT/" title="MESI protocol" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/30XT/" display-uri="30XT" type="local">MESI protocol</fr:link> state — M/E, S, or miss?</html:p>
  
  
  
 <html:div class="jms-callout" style="
  margin: 1.1rem 0;
  padding: 0.1rem 0 0.1rem 0.9rem;
  border-left: 2px solid rgb(63, 83, 127);
