  <html:details><html:summary><html:span class="foldout" style="font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);">Answer</html:span></html:summary>
  <html:ul><html:li><html:strong>M or E</html:strong> — write directly; no fabric transaction at all, since E<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\to ]]></fr:tex>M is a silent upgrade.</html:li>
    <html:li><html:strong>S</html:strong> — issue the Upgrade/GetM now if the speculative one didn't land, and stall until permission arrives.</html:li>
    <html:li><html:strong>Miss</html:strong> — issue GetM to fetch the data and invalidate sharers, allocate an <fr:link href="/89LS/" title="Miss status handling register" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/89LS/" display-uri="89LS" type="local">Miss status handling register</fr:link>, stall.</html:li></html:ul>

  Drain is decoupled from commit and, under <fr:link href="/VH8Y/" title="Total store order" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/VH8Y/" display-uri="VH8Y" type="local">Total store order</fr:link>, in order — so a stalled head blocks younger senior stores even when their lines are already in M.
</html:details>
